// Finding the current session in a replayed log. The current session is the last
// session_plan event (log/FORMAT.md); what has happened in it is every event
// after that one. session_count_after counts events of one kind there, and the
// answers to "how far along is it" are differences of those counts: attempts
// made against items moved past.

session_plan_index(Log_events session_events) {
  int session_found = 0 - 1;
  int session_at = 0;
  while (session_at < len(session_events.kinds)) {
    if (session_events.kinds[session_at] == "session_plan") {
      session_found = session_at;
    }
    session_at = session_at + 1;
  }
} return int session_found;
